      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3097a2e76d5ac5bdfd72e4a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我怀抱复杂的心情，\n注视着乐不可支的富士奇石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "225e22e2526f2db4f186b50181ecd0edb69998dd64914d04361e36b9c9b4e214",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a80f729494bb9577eae724",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "站在她的立场来看，她八成是顾虑到那位\n害她受伤的赛马娘，而不愿让其他人操心吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a27e11b584897d5668d259745e4db865ee3be00532e8ef2935d8a12a6074f48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f44b52c124bcf56a544331d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她的症状有可能会恶化。于是我决定\n在尊重她这份心意的同时，前往贩卖部\n“不动声色地”买一份慰问品给她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "591ea14376728e2d6c503a063ce1f437a6490ad4afde31daa9b1b19269980d05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71dfd502859d56108243f19a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb5b6468da652195cc286bb381cbdccbd156b6c761055b768718c2d7de927d0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
