    {
      "uid": "zhcn:618e169bc399afa92a7435ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我买了贴布和她喜欢的东西，\n然后装得像是整袋放满了食物一样。\n接着──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd72784cefcf6b9c4d83747bc5c38ccd4eb09b2ce8681e5477de98f3ed6f6dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005515.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03f0406143815d6c10559199",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士有东西忘了拿，你可以帮忙送回宿舍吗？",
